<section id="10004_S0014" variety="S0014">
<name>Service Data</name>
<ttl id="10004_S0014_746R9_T00CU" variety="T00CU">
<name>Setting Procedure When Disconnecting/Reconnecting Battery Terminal</name>
<para id="RM000001LYW01QX" category="F" type-id="801HB" name-id="033T0-02" from="200810" to="200912">
<name>Work List</name>
<subpara id="RM000001LYW01QX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HWC00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.12in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" align="center" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Work Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Work Procedure</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Symptom if Not Performed / Function That Does Not Operate</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Remarks</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Intelligent Parking System Initialization</ptxt>
<ptxt>(w/ Intelligent Parking System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Turning the steering wheel fully to both the left and right on a flat road corrects the steering angle neutral point</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Intelligent Parking System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>With manual neutral point memorization</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000P3T006X"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Initialization of Back Guide Monitor System</ptxt>
<ptxt>(w/ Back Guide Monitor System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Turning the steering wheel fully to both the left and right on a flat road corrects the steering angle neutral point</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Back Guide Monitor System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>With manual neutral point memorization</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000163U007X"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten3>
<ptxt>If the battery terminal has been disconnected and reconnected, the steering lock may not release and the engine may not start. In that case, open and close the driver door once with the ignition OFF to return to normal.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
